description.en:
[Triangulation] deals additional Mental DMG/Genesis DMG equal to 100% of the base value, and at Incantation rank 1/2/3, additionally grants self 1/1/2 stack(s) of [Enlightenment];
[Curve Mapping] deals additional Mental DMG/Genesis DMG equal to 100% of the base value, and grants [Sturdiness] to all allies;
[Supplementary Formula] deals additional Mental DMG/Genesis DMG equal to 150% of the base value.

[To the "Family"] effect enhanced:
[Tactical Coordination]: the Ultimate DMG provided per stack of [Readiness] is increased by 20% of the base value;
[Armament Enhancement]: the Critical Rate provided is increased by 20% of the base value

[Climactic Moment] new effect: when recast 1 time in a single round, deals additional Mental DMG to all enemies equal to 50% of the base Mental DMG;
when recast 2 times in a single round, deals additional Mental DMG to all enemies equal to 50% of the base Mental DMG, and for every 1 type of [Neg Status] the target holds, additionally increases Mental DMG/Penetration Rate by 50% of the original base;
when recast 3 or more times in a single round, deals additional Mental DMG to all enemies equal to 100% of the base Mental DMG, and for every 1 type of [Neg Status] the target holds, additionally increases Mental DMG/Penetration Rate by 100% of the original base
